this is an experience.

00:00:46.745 --> 00:00:49.041
- Look at that, yeah.

00:00:49.041 --> 00:00:50.341
- It has a weird texture.

00:00:50.341 --> 00:00:51.541
- Too stringy for me.

00:00:51.541 --> 00:00:52.515
- I like it.

00:00:52.515 --> 00:00:54.039
- I can't even finish swallowing this.

00:00:54.039 --> 00:00:56.030
- It's like your friend
that won't let go of you.

