wafer crisp chocolate bar.

00:01:16.515 --> 00:01:17.856
I'm in (beep) Heaven right now.

00:01:17.856 --> 00:01:19.908
- Oh, is there coffee in here? Uh uh, no.

00:01:19.908 --> 00:01:21.920
- I do not get the coffee flavor at all.

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:24.805
- It melts in your mouth and
it's crunchy at the same time.

00:01:24.805 --> 00:01:27.443
- I would eat these like crazy
if they were available to me.

00:01:29.367 --> 00:01:30.830
- [Both] Ooh!

00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:32.021
- They are cute!

00:01:32.021 --> 00:01:33.951
