00:01:39.054 --> 00:01:40.010
I kinda like it, though.

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:41.737
- This is definitely the best one so far.

00:01:41.737 --> 00:01:42.570
- I like it.

00:01:42.570 --> 00:01:43.364
- I like that.

00:01:43.364 --> 00:01:44.643
